    <briefdescription>
<para>Distributed / multi-shard aggregation coordinator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In single-node mode this is a thin wrapper around <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_continuous_aggregate_manager" kindref="compound">ContinuousAggregateManager</ref>. In multi-shard mode the caller provides a shard query callback; the coordinator fans out the refresh request to all shards in parallel and merges the partial results. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
